--- !u!114 &1274326168303862403
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3752300061302600148}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 36422ed2236b4ef4d88887b861d3bdcc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  buttonText:
    fi: "\nLupiini\n\nLupiini on korkea kasvi, jolla on sinisen, vaaleanpunaisen
      tai valkoisen kirjava kukinto. Se kasvaa usein tienvarsilla ja niityill\xE4,
      mutta levi\xE4\xE4 my\xF6s kosteikkojen l\xE4heisyyteen, miss\xE4 se rikastaa
      maaper\xE4\xE4 typell\xE4 ja syrj\xE4ytt\xE4\xE4 muita lajeja.\n"
    sw: "\nLupin\n\nLupin \xE4r en h\xF6gv\xE4xt med brokiga blommor i bl\xE5tt,
      rosa eller vitt. Den v\xE4xer ofta l\xE4ngs v\xE4gar och p\xE5 \xE4ngar, men
      sprider sig \xE4ven i n\xE4rheten av v\xE5tmarker, d\xE4r den berikar jorden
      med kv\xE4ve och tr\xE4nger undan andra arter."
    en: '

      Lupine


      The lupine is a tall plant with variegated blue,
      pink, or white flowers. It often grows along roadsides and in meadows, but
      also spreads to areas near wetlands, where it enriches the soil with nitrogen
      and displaces other species.'
